{"2436070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prophecy", "steam_appid": 2436070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Prophecy </strong>is a narrative-driven first person game with puzzles and interactive story telling inspired by the legend of the Mothman.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/972103d9041942da46135879c66bc1a7.poster.avif?t=1727728648\" width=580 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/972103d9041942da46135879c66bc1a7.webm?t=1727728648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/972103d9041942da46135879c66bc1a7.mp4?t=1727728648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Caleb Dewspring goes back to his childhood home after his estranged father is found dead. He discovers his father's obsession with local sightings of a winged moth-like creature and a strange man in black. Will his search for answers uncover the secrets behind what's plaguing the small town of Point Pleasant, West Virginia?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/2ec2d35c943923491c3604d8d5052790.poster.avif?t=1727728648\" width=580 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/2ec2d35c943923491c3604d8d5052790.webm?t=1727728648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436070/extras/2ec2d35c943923491c3604d8d5052790.mp4?t=1727728648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Encounter and evade the Mothman while traversing through multiple environments.<br><span class=\"bb_i